        <p>01</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="160" topLeftY="66" width="740" height="44">
      <content textType="headline" fontSize="27" bold="true" color="rgba(155,18,34,1)" fontFamily="思源宋体">
        <p>百花齐放、百家争鸣</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <line startX="162" startY="126" endX="330" endY="126">
      <border color="rgba(198,156,86,1)" width="2"/>
    </line>

    <shape type="ellipse" topLeftX="82" topLeftY="178" width="12" height="12">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgba(178,24,43,1)"/></fill>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="108" topLeftY="166" width="800" height="70">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="16" color="rgba(51,51,51,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4">
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(155,18,34,1)">方针定位：</span>艺术上不同形式和风格自由发展，科学上不同学派自由争论；用行政力量强制推行单一风格学派，会有害于艺术和科学的发展。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="ellipse" topLeftX="82" topLeftY="288" width="12" height="12">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgba(178,24,43,1)"/></fill>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="108" topLeftY="276" width="800" height="70">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="16" color="rgba(51,51,51,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4">
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(155,18,34,1)">"种牛痘"的比喻：</span>让人适当接触一点错误思想，反而能增强辨别真理的"免疫力"；温室里培养出来的东西，经不起风雨。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="ellipse" topLeftX="82" topLeftY="398" width="12" height="12">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgba(178,24,43,1)"/></fill>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="108" topLeftY="386" width="800" height="70">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="16" color="rgba(51,51,51,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4">
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(155,18,34,1)">民主方法：</span>思想性质的问题只能用讨论、批评、说理来解决，压而不服；这是"团结—批评—团结"公式在文化领域的延伸。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="0" topLeftY="504" width="960" height="36">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgba(178,24,43,1)"/></fill>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="70" topLeftY="511" width="820" height="24">
      <content textType="caption" fontSize="13" color="rgba(255,255,255,1)">
        <p>让知识分子安心创作与探索——有制度保障，不必动辄得咎</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
  </data>
  <note>
    <content textType="body">
      <p>第一点是双百方针。毛泽东明确说，艺术和科学上的不同风格、不同学派都可以自由发展，不能靠行政命令强行推广一种。他还打了个比方叫"种牛痘"，就是让人适当接触错误思想，反而能增强对错误的免疫力。说到底，思想问题只能靠讨论和说理解决，这是团结—批评—团结在文化领域的运用。</p>
    </content>
  </note>
